hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"256","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban Abu Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Malik bin Umair ne Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Abul Haisam se kaha: kya tumhare paas koi khadim hai? Unhon ne kaha: nahin. Unhon ne kaha: jab hamare paas qaidi aayen to hamare paas aana. Phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas do qaidi laaye gaye, un ke saath koi teesra na tha. Abul Haisam un ke paas aaye. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: in dono mein se chun lo. Unhon ne kaha: aye Allah ke Rasool! mere liye aap hi chun dijiye. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: jis se mashwara manga jaye woh amanatdar hai. Ise le lo, kyunke maine ise namaz padhte dekha hai, aur is ke baare mein bhalai ki wasiyyat qubool karo. Un ki biwi ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne is ke baare mein jo kaha hai, tum use poora nahin kar sakte, siwa is ke keh tum ise azaad kar do. Unhon ne kaha: to yeh azaad hai. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: Allah ne koi Nabi ya khalifa nahin bheja, magar us ke do batanah (qareebi raazdaan) hote hain: ek batanah use neki ka hukm deta hai aur burai se rokta hai, aur ek batanah use nuqsan pahunchane mein koi kasar nahin chhodta. Jise bure batanah se bacha liya gaya, woh bacha liya gaya."
"257","Sadaqa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaina ne Umar bin Habib se, unhon ne Amr bin Dinar se humein bataya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas padhte the: aur baaz muamlaat mein un se mashwara karo."
"258","Adam bin Abi Iyas ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne Sari se, unhon ne Hasan se hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Koi qaum mashwara nahin karti magar use us ke samne maujood behtareen baat ki hidayat milti hai. Phir unhon ne tilawat ki: aur un ka kaam un ke darmiyan aapas ke mashware se hota hai."
"259","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Abi Ayyub ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bukair bin Amr ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Usman Muslim bin Yasar se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: jo mere baare mein woh baat kahe jo maine nahin kahi, woh Jahannam mein apna thikana bana le. Aur jis ka Musalman bhai us se mashwara mange, aur woh use sahi raaste ke khilaf mashwara de, us ne us ke saath khayanat ki. Aur jise pukhta ilm ke baghair fatwa diya gaya, us ka gunah fatwa dene wale par hoga."
